  "staging": "AJCC 8th edition pTNM derived by src/staging/pancreas.js. pT1-pT3 are assigned on tumour size alone (T1a 0.5 cm or less, T1b over 0.5 up to 1 cm, T1c over 1 up to 2 cm, T2 over 2 up to 4 cm, T3 over 4 cm); extrapancreatic extension is recorded but does not raise pT. pT4 is arterial involvement only (coeliac axis, superior mesenteric artery or common hepatic artery) - venous involvement is not pT4 in this edition. pN1 is 1 to 3 involved nodes, pN2 is 4 or more. pTNM prints only with the printPTNM option, stamped (AJCC 8th edition). Treatment effect maps to the y descriptor automatically.",
